From: mesa-kbase-j4lte
Subject: [PATCH] panfrost: emulate up to 4 render targets on Midgard v4

Midgard v4 (T720) only has the single-target framebuffer descriptor. Do
what the Arm driver does for mixed-format MRT (docs/MRT-RE.md, path B):
run the vertex/tiler work once and one fragment job per render target.
Every draw gets one draw descriptor copy per RT, 128 bytes apart, each
pointing at a fragment shader variant that writes only that RT (as RT0)
with its blend state; pass i's SFBD selects copy i with "DCD Offset".
All passes start from the same Z/S state and only the last writes it.
